<title>UK: RHEINHYP sets 250 mln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP sets 250 mln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINHYP RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.60	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.33     PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FEES UNDISCLOSED     LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
